498
00:17:58,160 --> 00:18:00,240
A leader doesn't have a script,

499
00:18:00,840 --> 00:18:02,820
they have a set of competencies

500
00:18:02,820 --> 00:18:03,500
and skills,

501
00:18:03,720 --> 00:18:04,780
they have a set of resources,

502
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:05,720
they take their group,

503
00:18:06,220 --> 00:18:07,400
they lead them towards a goal.

504
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:09,700
