528
00:18:46,680 --> 00:18:48,100
We don't want to compel them.

529
00:18:50,180 --> 00:18:51,380
Let's encourage them,

530
00:18:51,840 --> 00:18:52,500
as leaders,

531
00:18:53,120 --> 00:18:54,580
to take their group

532
00:18:54,580 --> 00:18:55,420
