544
00:19:12,160 --> 00:19:13,740
or skills you didn't plan on using.

545
00:19:15,840 --> 00:19:16,960
And then watch them

546
00:19:16,960 --> 00:19:17,780
get their group through

547
00:19:17,780 --> 00:19:18,360
to the goal.

548
00:19:19,340 --> 00:19:20,960
That's what we're really looking for

549
00:19:20,960 --> 00:19:22,700
